>av5410@sjfc.UUCP (Alex Villamil) writes:

>I've read that Wizard mode doesn't work on Suns. I'm running nethack on X11
>on a Sparcstation IPC. Could someone give me an explanation as to why it
>won't work?
 
>Thanx,
>Alex

   Wizard mode works fine on SUNS. The problem is that a workstation is a
multiuser machine. When NetHack is installed only one user (often root)
can be listed as the wizard. Only this user has the option of using wizard
mode.

